endpoint.response:
{ success: true, message: "OK", data: {
    applied: { date_from, date_to, company_id: int[], company_site_id: int[], operational_site_id: int[],
               document_type: string, group_by: string, top: int },
    today: "YYYY-MM-DD",
    receivable: Side,
    payable: Side & { by_cost_type: CostTypeRow[] },
    committed: {
      total: number, with_work_order: number, without_work_order: number,
      by_supplier: CommittedTopRow[],          (top N per impegnato decrescente)
      by_cost_type: CostTypeRow[]              (ordine catalogo; senza tipo ultimo)
    },
    exposure: {
      receivable_open: number, payable_open: number, committed_total: number, net: number,
      by_dimension: ExposureRow[]              (ordinate per label; "unattributed" ultimo)
    },
    concentration: {
      invoiced_total: number, overdue_total: number,
      top_invoiced_share: number,              (quota cumulata delle prime N sul fatturato, 0..100 con 1 decimale)
      top_overdue_share: number,
      rows: ConcentrationRow[]                 (prime N per fatturato decrescente)
    }
} }

Side = {
  open_total: number,            (somma residui delle rate aperte, a oggi)
  overdue_total: number,         (residui con due_date < today)
  not_due_total: number,         (residui con due_date >= today)
  aging: { due_0_30: number, due_31_60: number, due_over_60: number,
           overdue_1_30: number, overdue_31_60: number, overdue_61_90: number, overdue_over_90: number },
  invoiced_in_period: number,    (documenti con document_date nel periodo, D-3)
  settled_in_period: number,     (collected_amount / paid_amount delle rate con collected_at / paid_at nel periodo)
  average_days: int | null,      (DSO / DPO, D-6)
  by_status: { paid: StatusCell, not_due: StatusCell, overdue: StatusCell, seriously_overdue: StatusCell },
  top: TopRow[]                  (D-7)
}
StatusCell = { documents: int, open: number }
TopRow = { registry: { id: int, name: string }, open: number, overdue: number,
           worst_bucket: "overdue_over_90"|"overdue_61_90"|"overdue_31_60"|"overdue_1_30"|"due_0_30"|"due_31_60"|"due_over_60" }
CostTypeRow = { cost_type: { id: int, name: string, color: string|null, nature: "direct"|"indirect"|"general"|null } | null,
                open: number, overdue: number }          (per il passivo; per gli impegni `open` = impegnato, `overdue` = 0)
CommittedTopRow = { registry: { id: int, name: string }, committed: number, orders: int }
ExposureRow = { key: string, label: string|null, receivable_open: number, payable_open: number,
                committed: number, net: number }
ConcentrationRow = { registry: { id: int, name: string }, invoiced: number, invoiced_share: number,
                     overdue: number, overdue_share: number }

Importi: number con 2 decimali sul totale documento (D-6 di 0268), calcolati in centesimi. Quote in
percentuale con 1 decimale. Invarianti: open_total = overdue_total + not_due_total = somma delle 7 fasce;
somma di by_dimension campo per campo = i totali di exposure; exposure.net = receivable_open -
payable_open - committed_total.
